# HISIM-like material library for CIM chiplet thermal stack.
# Used by -materials_file flag; only entries referenced from config are loaded.

# Format:
#
# material name
# material type (solid or fluid)
# thermal conductivity in W/(m-K)
# volumetric heat capacity in J/(m^3-K)
# dynamic viscosity in Pa-s (fluid only)

